Not included, on purpose
------------------------

Tech4Sport's files. Neither the vendor's firmware application nor its stock layout files are
part of this repository; the layouts shipped here are written for this project and keep only the
shared section and layout names. firmware/openscore/PROVENANCE.md describes how openscore relates
to the vendor code.

Arial. The vendor board renders text with Monotype's ARIAL.TTF, which is proprietary and may not
be redistributed; openscore uses the metric-compatible Liberation Sans.
